@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
title AFTER MVP — Proposed reviewed send and uncertain response handling
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant "Communication handler" as H
database "Intent / attempt records" as DB
participant "Bounded worker" as W
participant "Evaluated provider adapter" as P
User -> H : explicit reviewed sender/recipient/content/artifacts
H -> H : current authority + intent/version identity
H -> DB : commit pending intent + attributable attempt
DB --> H : local commit outcome
H --> User : permitted pending/result reference
W -> DB : atomically claim exact attempt
W -> W : recheck capability and dispatch eligibility
W -> P : send exact reviewed intent
alt actual provider result observed
 P --> W : acceptance / rejection evidence
 W -> DB : record supported outcome under current claim
else response lost after possible dispatch
 W -> DB : retain UNKNOWN + bounded evidence
 note over W,P
 No blind resend on queue retry or lease expiry.
 Reconcile the same attempt only through actual supported evidence.
 end note
end
note over H,DB
 Acceptance is not receipt or application progress.
 No automatic submitted-material capture.
end note
@enduml
